<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<bpmn:definitions xmlns:bioc="http://bpmn.io/schema/bpmn/biocolor/1.0" xmlns:bpmn="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL" xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI" xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC" xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:zeebe="http://camunda.org/schema/zeebe/1.0" xmlns:modeler="http://camunda.org/schema/modeler/1.0" id="Definitions_Hospital_Simple_C8" targetNamespace="https://aisd.example/hospital/simple-c8" exporter="Camunda Modeler" exporterVersion="5.51.0" modeler:executionPlatform="Camunda Cloud" modeler:executionPlatformVersion="8.10.0">
  <bpmn:collaboration id="Collaboration_Hospital_Simple">
    <bpmn:participant id="Hospital" name="HOSPITAL | Patient pathway and supporting services" processRef="Hospital_All_Processes_Simple_C8" />
    <bpmn:participant id="Referrer" name="Referring organisation | GP / Other hospital" />
    <bpmn:participant id="Patient" name="Patient / authorised representative" />
    <bpmn:participant id="PaymentProvider" name="External Payment Service Provider" />
    <bpmn:messageFlow id="Msg_Referral" name="Referral documents" sourceRef="Referrer" targetRef="Register" />
    <bpmn:messageFlow id="Msg_Contact" name="Appointment / contact" sourceRef="BookVisit" targetRef="Patient" />
    <bpmn:messageFlow id="Msg_Treatment" name="Treatment arrangements" sourceRef="SendBookingConfirmation" targetRef="Patient" />
    <bpmn:messageFlow id="Msg_PaymentRequest" name="Payment request" sourceRef="RequestPayment" targetRef="PaymentProvider" />
    <bpmn:messageFlow id="Msg_Payment" name="Verified transaction result" sourceRef="PaymentProvider" targetRef="PaymentReceived" />
    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="Stage_1">
      <bpmn:text>1  REFERRAL REVIEW</bpmn:text>
    </bpmn:textAnnotation>
    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="Stage_2">
      <bpmn:text>2  VISIT AND CLINICAL CARE</bpmn:text>
    </bpmn:textAnnotation>
    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="Stage_3">
      <bpmn:text>3  LETTER AND NEXT STEP</bpmn:text>
    </bpmn:textAnnotation>
    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="Stage_4">
      <bpmn:text>4  FUNDING AND TREATMENT</bpmn:text>
    </bpmn:textAnnotation>
    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="Change_Section">
      <bpmn:text>CHANGES / CANCELLATIONS</bpmn:text>
    </bpmn:textAnnotation>
    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="Guide_Main">
      <bpmn:text>READING GUIDE | Blue = main care route (left to right by stage). Grey = side / exception paths kept on lane edges.
Stages: 1 Referral review → 2 Visit &amp; clinical care → 3 Letter &amp; next step → 4 Funding &amp; treatment. Changes sit on the lower clinical band.
All P1-P13 tasks remain visible. Payment uses a send task + payment-result message catch (Est pattern); booking confirmation uses a send task worker. Member B added check-slot, reserve-appointment, flag-resource-unavailable service tasks (Admin lane hang points). Member A added request-refund (after FinanceAdjustment) and mark-payment-investigate (before FundingIssue). External scheduling / correspondence / insurer stay as worker or user-task simulation — no empty white-box pools. Member D adds one notify-care-change service task with a database receipt. Enquiries end after the human response.</bpmn:text>
    </bpmn:textAnnotation>
    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="Guide_Rules">
      <bpmn:text>BUSINESS CONTROLS | P4: within 2 weeks, also phone and record contact. P9: 7-day letter target; weekly reminders; escalate at 1 and 3 months.
P7: unknown payment confirmation -&gt; investigate; never automatically charge again. P8: clinical urgent-care authorisation then Finance follow-up.
P11/P12: formal clinical change first; Finance approves affected payments / refunds. P13: identity, authorised roles and audit apply throughout.</bpmn:text>
    </bpmn:textAnnotation>
  </bpmn:collaboration>
  <bpmn:process id="Hospital_All_Processes_Simple_C8" name="Hospital - All Business Processes (Simple Camunda 8)" isExecutable="true">
    <bpmn:documentation>Student demonstration based on the supplied hospital case and completed P1-P13 table. All flow nodes are expanded on one canvas; no collapsed subprocesses. Existing-care changes, enquiries and reports have independent request triggers represented by the Register request choice. P13 controls apply at every task, not only the reporting branch. Most external interactions and elapsed time are simulated manually via user tasks. Payment follows the Est / Message Example pattern: send task request-payment publishes BPMN message payment-result (correlation key case_reference); intermediate catch PaymentReceived consumes it. Booking confirmation is send task send-booking-confirmation (worker completes the job; no separate inbound message wait). There are no timers. Hospital roles are grouped into administrative, clinical and finance lanes. Demo tasks are assigned to demo; production permissions, immutable audit storage, real integrations and clinical rules are outside this classroom model. User tasks use dedicated Camunda forms with hardcoded select options (no valuesKey). Task-specific output mappings feed FEEL gateway conditions. Blank/invalid decisions return to the relevant human review rather than silently approving.</bpmn:documentation>
    <bpmn:laneSet id="Hospital_Lanes">
      <bpmn:lane id="Finance" name="Finance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Funding</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>FundingOutcome</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>RequestPayment</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>PaymentReceived</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>PaymentResult</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>FundingIssue</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>FinanceAdjustment</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>RequestRefund</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>AdjustmentOutcome</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>MarkPaymentInvestigate</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>FinanceEnquiry</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>EndFinanceEnquiry</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>UrgentFinance</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      </bpmn:lane>
      <bpmn:lane id="Clinical" name="Clinical team">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>ReviewReferral</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>ReferralDecision</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>EndRejected</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>ClinicalCare</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>UrgentFollowupNeeded</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>CarePlan</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>UrgentAuthorisation</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>EndCare</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>ClinicalChange</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>ChangeValid</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>MoneyAffected</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>ChangeRoute</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>ClinicalEnquiry</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>EndClinicalEnquiry</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>UrgentDecision</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>NotifyCareChange</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      </bpmn:lane>
      <bpmn:lane id="Admin" name="Administration">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Start</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Register</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>RequestType</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>GetDocuments</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Redirect</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>EndReferral</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>BookVisit</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>VisitOutcome</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>DispatchLetter</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>LetterOutcome</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>MonitorLetters</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>BookTreatment</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>TreatmentOutcome</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>AdminEnquiry</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>EndAdminEnquiry</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>AuditReports</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>EndReport</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>CheckVisitSlot</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>FlagResourceUnavailable</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>SendBookingConfirmation</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>ReserveTreatmentSlot</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      </bpmn:lane>
    </bpmn:laneSet>
    <bpmn:startEvent id="Start" name="Start request">
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_01</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:startEvent>
    <bpmn:userTask id="Register" name="P1 / P10 / P13&#10;Register request;&#10;check documents and ID">
      <bpmn:documentation>Medical Secretaries / Call Handling: identify patient and existing case; check referral documents without judging clinical suitability. Select request type. Record enquiry priority, owner and receipt time; flag urgent clinical concerns immediately. Existing-care requests must reference the authorised case. Demo only; enter no real patient or card data.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
        <zeebe:userTask />
        <zeebe:formDefinition formId="register_request" />
        <zeebe:assignmentDefinition assignee="demo" />
        <zeebe:ioMapping>
          <zeebe:input source="= if is defined(patientId) then patientId else &#34;&#34;" target="patientId" />
          <zeebe:input source="= if is defined(specialty) then specialty else null" target="specialty" />
          <zeebe:input source="= if is defined(priority) then priority else null" target="priority" />
          <zeebe:input source="= if is defined(timeframe) then timeframe else &#34;&#34;" target="timeframe" />
          <zeebe:input source="= null" target="action" />
          <zeebe:input source="= &#34;&#34;" target="notes" />
          <zeebe:output source="= patientId" target="patientId" />
          <zeebe:output source="= specialty" target="specialty" />
          <zeebe:output source="= priority" target="priority" />
          <zeebe:output source="= timeframe" target="timeframe" />
          <zeebe:output source="= notes" target="RegisterNotes" />
          <zeebe:output source="= action" target="requestKind" />
          <zeebe:output source="= false" target="urgentCase" />
        </zeebe:ioMapping>
      </bpmn:extensionElements>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_01</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_24</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_30</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_02</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:userTask>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="RequestType" name="Request&#10;type?" default="Flow_24">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_02</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_03</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_18</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_19</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_20</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_21</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_22</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_23</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_24</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:exclusiveGateway>
    <bpmn:userTask id="GetDocuments" name="P1 / P11&#10;Obtain missing or&#10;formally authorised records">
      <bpmn:documentation>Request and record receipt of missing referral material, or obtain a formally authorised modification request. Do not treat an email or phone call as treatment-change authorisation. In the classroom, completing this task simulates the reply; do not wait for an external message.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
        <zeebe:userTask />
        <zeebe:formDefinition formId="simple_record" />
        <zeebe:assignmentDefinition assignee="demo" />
        <zeebe:ioMapping>
          <zeebe:input source="= if is defined(patientId) then patientId else &#34;&#34;" target="patientId" />
          <zeebe:input source="= if is defined(staffRole) then staffRole else &#34;&#34;" target="staffRole" />
          <zeebe:input source="= null" target="action" />
          <zeebe:input source="= &#34;&#34;" target="notes" />
          <zeebe:output source="= patientId" target="patientId" />
          <zeebe:output source="= staffRole" target="staffRole" />
          <zeebe:output source="= notes" target="GetDocumentsNotes" />
        </zeebe:ioMapping>
      </bpmn:extensionElements>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_19</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_29</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_52</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_30</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:userTask>
    <bpmn:userTask id="ReviewReferral" name="P2&#10;Consultant reviews referral;&#10;records decision and reason">
      <bpmn:documentation>Only an authorised Consultant decides acceptance. Record decision, clinician identity and reason. Urgent referrals and requested timeframes must be passed to booking staff.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
        <zeebe:userTask />
        <zeebe:formDefinition formId="review_referral" />
        <zeebe:assignmentDefinition assignee="demo" />
        <zeebe:ioMapping>
          <zeebe:input source="= if is defined(patientId) then patientId else &#34;&#34;" target="patientId" />
          <zeebe:input source="= if is defined(clinicianId) then clinicianId else &#34;&#34;" target="clinicianId" />
          <zeebe:input source="= &#34;&#34;" target="decisionReason" />
          <zeebe:input source="= null" target="action" />
          <zeebe:input source="= &#34;&#34;" target="notes" />
          <zeebe:output source="= patientId" target="patientId" />
          <zeebe:output source="= clinicianId" target="clinicianId" />
          <zeebe:output source="= decisionReason" target="decisionReason" />
          <zeebe:output source="= notes" target="ReviewReferralNotes" />
          <zeebe:output source="= action" target="referralDecision" />
        </zeebe:ioMapping>
      </bpmn:extensionElements>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_03</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_34</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_04</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:userTask>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="ReferralDecision" name="Referral&#10;decision?" default="Flow_34">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_04</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_05</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_29</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_31</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_33</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_34</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:exclusiveGateway>
    <bpmn:userTask id="Redirect" name="P2&#10;Record authorised redirect&#10;and notify referrer">
      <bpmn:documentation>Administrative staff carry out the Consultant-approved redirect and record its destination; they do not make the clinical decision.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
        <zeebe:userTask />
        <zeebe:formDefinition formId="simple_record" />
        <zeebe:assignmentDefinition assignee="demo" />
        <zeebe:ioMapping>
          <zeebe:input source="= if is defined(patientId) then patientId else &#34;&#34;" target="patientId" />
          <zeebe:input source="= if is defined(staffRole) then staffRole else &#34;&#34;" target="staffRole" />
          <zeebe:input source="= null" target="action" />
          <zeebe:input source="= &#34;&#34;" target="notes" />
          <zeebe:output source="= patientId" target="patientId" />
          <zeebe:output source="= staffRole" target="staffRole" />
          <zeebe:output source="= notes" target="RedirectNotes" />
        </zeebe:ioMapping>
      </bpmn:extensionElements>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_31</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_32</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:userTask>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="EndReferral" name="Referral closed">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_32</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="EndRejected" name="Referral rejected">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_33</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:userTask id="BookVisit" name="P3 / P4 / P12&#10;Book visit; notify patient;&#10;record attendance / contact">
      <bpmn:documentation>Outpatient Bookings: only after referral acceptance or a clinical follow-up request. Confirm a slot within the requested timeframe; if unavailable keep pending, flag to the pathway team and avoid duplicates. Send an appointment letter. If within two weeks ALSO phone and record each attempt/outcome, including failed contact or an alternative date. Record attendance, cancellation, decline or DNA. Classroom completion represents these actions and elapsed time.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
        <zeebe:userTask />
        <zeebe:formDefinition formId="book_visit" />
        <zeebe:assignmentDefinition assignee="demo" />
        <zeebe:ioMapping>
          <zeebe:input source="= if is defined(patientId) then patientId else &#34;&#34;" target="patientId" />
          <zeebe:input source="= if is defined(staffRole) then staffRole else &#34;&#34;" target="staffRole" />
          <zeebe:input source="= null" target="action" />
          <zeebe:input source="= &#34;&#34;" target="notes" />
          <zeebe:output source="= patientId" target="patientId" />
          <zeebe:output source="= staffRole" target="staffRole" />
          <zeebe:output source="= notes" target="BookVisitNotes" />
          <zeebe:output source="= action" target="visitOutcome" />
        </zeebe:ioMapping>
      </bpmn:extensionElements>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_05</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_35</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_42</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_60</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_06</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:userTask>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="VisitOutcome" name="Visit&#10;outcome?" default="Flow_35">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_06b</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_07</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_35</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_36</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:exclusiveGateway>
    <bpmn:userTask id="ClinicalCare" name="P5 / P9 / P12&#10;Consult / treat / review;&#10;authorise care and clinic letter">
      <bpmn:documentation>Consultant / authorised clinician: record consultation, treatment and review as applicable. Before each subsequent chemotherapy cycle, review blood tests and fitness before giving treatment; only authorised clinicians decide whether to continue, delay or change the plan. Treatment requires patient consent and an authorised request with dates, cycles and resources. Decide further treatment, follow-up or discharge; prepare and approve the clinic letter and recipients after EVERY consultation. Give CNS contact information after the first visit. A returned letter is corrected and reapproved without repeating treatment. No administrative or finance user may make these clinical decisions.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
        <zeebe:userTask />
        <zeebe:formDefinition formId="clinical_care" />
        <zeebe:assignmentDefinition assignee="demo" />
        <zeebe:ioMapping>
          <zeebe:input source="= if is defined(patientId) then patientId else &#34;&#34;" target="patientId" />
          <zeebe:input source="= if is defined(staffRole) then staffRole else &#34;&#34;" target="staffRole" />
          <zeebe:input source="= null" target="action" />
          <zeebe:input source="= &#34;&#34;" target="notes" />
          <zeebe:output source="= patientId" target="patientId" />
          <zeebe:output source="= staffRole" target="staffRole" />
          <zeebe:output source="= notes" target="ClinicalCareNotes" />
          <zeebe:output source="= action" target="careDecision" />
        </zeebe:ioMapping>
      </bpmn:extensionElements>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_07</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_66</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_39</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_41</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_43</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_08</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:userTask>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="UrgentFollowupNeeded" name="Urgent finance&#10;follow-up?" default="Flow_09">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_08</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_09</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_37</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:exclusiveGateway>
    <bpmn:userTask id="DispatchLetter" name="P9&#10;Check and dispatch&#10;approved clinic letter">
      <bpmn:documentation>Medical Secretaries: check administration and Consultant-approved recipients, send the approved letter, and record all relevant dates and dispatch method. Do not change clinical meaning. Suspected clinical errors return to the Consultant. Complete/approve/send within seven days; recipients normally receive within about two weeks. External correspondence is simulated by recording the result.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
        <zeebe:userTask />
        <zeebe:formDefinition formId="dispatch_letter" />
        <zeebe:assignmentDefinition assignee="demo" />
        <zeebe:ioMapping>
          <zeebe:input source="= if is defined(patientId) then patientId else &#34;&#34;" target="patientId" />
          <zeebe:input source="= if is defined(staffRole) then staffRole else &#34;&#34;" target="staffRole" />
          <zeebe:input source="= null" target="action" />
          <zeebe:input source="= &#34;&#34;" target="notes" />
          <zeebe:output source="= patientId" target="patientId" />
          <zeebe:output source="= staffRole" target="staffRole" />
          <zeebe:output source="= notes" target="DispatchLetterNotes" />
          <zeebe:output source="= action" target="letterStatus" />
        </zeebe:ioMapping>
      </bpmn:extensionElements>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_09</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_38</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_10</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:userTask>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="LetterOutcome" name="Letter&#10;status?" default="Flow_40">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_10</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_11</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_39</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_40</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:exclusiveGateway>
    <bpmn:userTask id="MonitorLetters" name="P9&#10;Monitor delay; remind&#10;and escalate if overdue">
      <bpmn:documentation>Patient Pathway Coordinators: after seven days mark delayed; send weekly reminders only while outstanding. Over one month escalate to Administrative Manager; over three months to higher management. Record reasons, reminders and responses; stop reminders after completion. Classroom demo records the applicable time band without a real multi-day timer.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
        <zeebe:userTask />
        <zeebe:formDefinition formId="simple_record" />
        <zeebe:assignmentDefinition assignee="demo" />
        <zeebe:ioMapping>
          <zeebe:input source="= if is defined(patientId) then patientId else &#34;&#34;" target="patientId" />
          <zeebe:input source="= if is defined(staffRole) then staffRole else &#34;&#34;" target="staffRole" />
          <zeebe:input source="= null" target="action" />
          <zeebe:input source="= &#34;&#34;" target="notes" />
          <zeebe:output source="= patientId" target="patientId" />
          <zeebe:output source="= staffRole" target="staffRole" />
          <zeebe:output source="= notes" target="MonitorLettersNotes" />
        </zeebe:ioMapping>
      </bpmn:extensionElements>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_40</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_41</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:userTask>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="CarePlan" name="Clinical&#10;plan?" default="Flow_43">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_11</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_12</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_17</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_42</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_43</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:exclusiveGateway>
    <bpmn:userTask id="Funding" name="P7&#10;Assess funding; record&#10;payment / approval status">
      <bpmn:documentation>Finance: establish hospital, insurer or patient funding before confirming treatment. Record insurer reference, amount and restrictions, or payment provider transaction reference/date/amount. Never store full card details. Advance payment needs verified success or an authorised funding/exemption/arrangement. Provider success with missing confirmation requires investigation, never an automatic second charge. Choose patient_payment_required to hand off to the request-payment worker; choose patient_paid only when payment is already verified without calling the provider.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
        <zeebe:userTask />
        <zeebe:formDefinition formId="funding_assessment" />
        <zeebe:assignmentDefinition assignee="demo" />
        <zeebe:ioMapping>
          <zeebe:input source="= if is defined(patientId) then patientId else &#34;&#34;" target="patientId" />
          <zeebe:input source="= if is defined(charge_amount) then charge_amount else &#34;&#34;" target="charge_amount" />
          <zeebe:input source="= if is defined(insurerReference) then insurerReference else &#34;&#34;" target="insurerReference" />
          <zeebe:input source="= null" target="action" />
          <zeebe:input source="= &#34;&#34;" target="notes" />
          <zeebe:output source="= patientId" target="patientId" />
          <zeebe:output source="= charge_amount" target="charge_amount" />
          <zeebe:output source="= insurerReference" target="insurerReference" />
          <zeebe:output source="= notes" target="FundingNotes" />
          <zeebe:output source="= action" target="fundingStatus" />
          <zeebe:output source="= patientId" target="case_reference" />
          <zeebe:output source="= false" target="payment_requested_once" />
        </zeebe:ioMapping>
      </bpmn:extensionElements>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_12</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_46</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_49</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_59</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_13</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:userTask>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="FundingOutcome" name="Funding&#10;status?" default="Flow_45">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_13</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_14</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_63</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_44</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_45</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:exclusiveGateway>
    <bpmn:sendTask id="RequestPayment" name="P7&#10;Send payment request&#10;to external provider">
      <bpmn:documentation>Classroom Java worker type request-payment (Est pattern). Mocks the Payment Provider, publishes BPMN message payment-result with correlation key case_reference (from patientId), then completes the job. Message variables: payment_status, transaction_reference, payment_date. Idempotent when payment_requested_once is already true. Does not store card data.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
        <zeebe:taskDefinition type="request-payment" />
      </bpmn:extensionElements>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_63</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_64</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:sendTask>
    <bpmn:intermediateCatchEvent id="PaymentReceived" name="P7&#10;Payment result&#10;received">
      <bpmn:documentation>Waits for BPMN message payment-result (correlation key = case_reference). Published by the request-payment worker after mocking the external provider.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_64</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_64b</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:messageEventDefinition id="PaymentMessageDefinition" messageRef="Message_PaymentResult" />
    </bpmn:intermediateCatchEvent>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="PaymentResult" name="Payment&#10;result?" default="Flow_67">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_64b</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_65</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_67</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:exclusiveGateway>
    <bpmn:userTask id="FundingIssue" name="P7&#10;Resolve funding issue /&#10;investigate missing receipt">
      <bpmn:documentation>Notify patient and booking team of failed, incomplete or duplicated payments. Check existing transaction before retrying, and avoid duplicate charges/bookings. Where the provider may already have taken payment, investigate/reconcile first; never request payment automatically. Record result before reassessing funding. Also reached when the request-payment worker returns an unsuccessful result.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
        <zeebe:userTask />
        <zeebe:formDefinition formId="simple_record" />
        <zeebe:assignmentDefinition assignee="demo" />
        <zeebe:ioMapping>
          <zeebe:input source="= if is defined(patientId) then patientId else &#34;&#34;" target="patientId" />
          <zeebe:input source="= if is defined(staffRole) then staffRole else &#34;&#34;" target="staffRole" />
          <zeebe:input source="= null" target="action" />
          <zeebe:input source="= &#34;&#34;" target="notes" />
          <zeebe:output source="= patientId" target="patientId" />
          <zeebe:output source="= staffRole" target="staffRole" />
          <zeebe:output source="= notes" target="FundingIssueNotes" />
        </zeebe:ioMapping>
      </bpmn:extensionElements>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_67b</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_46</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:userTask>
    <bpmn:userTask id="UrgentAuthorisation" name="P8&#10;Clinician authorises&#10;urgent care with reason">
      <bpmn:documentation>Only a clinician may authorise treatment before confirmed payment where delay risks the patient. Record clinician identity, clinical reason and the decision, and create a Finance follow-up obligation. Finance can request this review but cannot approve the clinical exception.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
        <zeebe:userTask />
        <zeebe:formDefinition formId="urgent_authorisation" />
        <zeebe:assignmentDefinition assignee="demo" />
        <zeebe:ioMapping>
          <zeebe:input source="= if is defined(patientId) then patientId else &#34;&#34;" target="patientId" />
          <zeebe:input source="= if is defined(clinicianId) then clinicianId else &#34;&#34;" target="clinicianId" />
          <zeebe:input source="= null" target="action" />
          <zeebe:input source="= &#34;&#34;" target="notes" />
          <zeebe:output source="= patientId" target="patientId" />
          <zeebe:output source="= clinicianId" target="clinicianId" />
          <zeebe:output source="= notes" target="UrgentAuthorisationNotes" />
          <zeebe:output source="= action" target="urgentDecision" />
          <zeebe:output source="= action = &#34;authorise&#34;" target="urgentCase" />
        </zeebe:ioMapping>
      </bpmn:extensionElements>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_44</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_47</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:userTask>
    <bpmn:userTask id="BookTreatment" name="P6&#10;Confirm authorised treatment&#10;and investigation appointments">
      <bpmn:documentation>Treatment / Chemotherapy Bookings: use the authorised clinical request and confirmed funding or documented urgent exception. Coordinate cycles, resources, laboratory/imaging and external services. If unavailable, keep pending, notify responsible staff and log retry attempts without duplicate appointments. Confirm booking only after these checks; patient notification is handed to the send-booking-confirmation worker after resources are ready. Classroom task records scheduling outcomes.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
        <zeebe:userTask />
        <zeebe:formDefinition formId="book_treatment" />
        <zeebe:assignmentDefinition assignee="demo" />
        <zeebe:ioMapping>
          <zeebe:input source="= if is defined(patientId) then patientId else &#34;&#34;" target="patientId" />
          <zeebe:input source="= if is defined(staffRole) then staffRole else &#34;&#34;" target="staffRole" />
          <zeebe:input source="= null" target="action" />
          <zeebe:input source="= &#34;&#34;" target="notes" />
          <zeebe:output source="= patientId" target="patientId" />
          <zeebe:output source="= staffRole" target="staffRole" />
          <zeebe:output source="= notes" target="BookTreatmentNotes" />
          <zeebe:output source="= action" target="treatmentSlotStatus" />
        </zeebe:ioMapping>
      </bpmn:extensionElements>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_14</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_65</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_48</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_50b</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_15</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:userTask>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="TreatmentOutcome" name="Resources&#10;ready?" default="Flow_50">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_15</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_16</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_50</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:exclusiveGateway>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="EndCare" name="Care episode ended">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_17</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_61</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:userTask id="ClinicalChange" name="P11 / P12&#10;Authorise modification,&#10;follow-up or cancellation">
      <bpmn:documentation>Consultant / authorised clinician: review formal treatment changes, DNA/cancellation or follow-up requests. Reject unapproved verbal/email changes. Urgent safety postponement must be promptly documented and authorised. Select the clinical plan and indicate whether existing charges/funding/payments are affected; this flags Finance review and does NOT authorise a refund.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
        <zeebe:userTask />
        <zeebe:formDefinition formId="clinical_change" />
        <zeebe:assignmentDefinition assignee="demo" />
        <zeebe:ioMapping>
          <zeebe:input source="= if is defined(patientId) then patientId else &#34;&#34;" target="patientId" />
          <zeebe:input source="= if is defined(clinicianId) then clinicianId else &#34;&#34;" target="clinicianId" />
          <zeebe:input source="= null" target="action" />
          <zeebe:input source="= &#34;&#34;" target="notes" />
          <zeebe:output source="= patientId" target="patientId" />
          <zeebe:output source="= clinicianId" target="clinicianId" />
          <zeebe:output source="= notes" target="ClinicalChangeNotes" />
          <zeebe:output source="= action" target="modificationDecision" />
          <zeebe:output source="= action = &#34;reschedule_paid&#34; or action = &#34;follow_up_paid&#34; or action = &#34;discharge_paid&#34;" target="moneyAffected" />
          <zeebe:output source="= if action = &#34;reschedule_paid&#34; or action = &#34;reschedule_unpaid&#34; then &#34;treatment&#34; else if action = &#34;follow_up_paid&#34; or action = &#34;follow_up_unpaid&#34; then &#34;visit&#34; else if action = &#34;discharge_paid&#34; or action = &#34;discharge_unpaid&#34; then &#34;discharge&#34; else &#34;invalid&#34;" target="changeTarget" />
        </zeebe:ioMapping>
      </bpmn:extensionElements>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_22</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_36</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_62</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_51</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:userTask>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="ChangeValid" name="Formal request&#10;authorised?" default="Flow_52">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_51_D</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_52</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_53</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:exclusiveGateway>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="MoneyAffected" name="Financial&#10;impact?" default="Flow_55">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_53</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_54</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_55</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:exclusiveGateway>
    <bpmn:userTask id="FinanceAdjustment" name="P7 / P11 / P12&#10;Approve and record refund,&#10;payment transfer or retention">
      <bpmn:documentation>Only authorised Finance approves full/partial refunds or payment transfer/retention. Record decision, amount, reason and provider result linked to patient, appointment and original transaction. Clinical staff supply treatment facts but do not approve refunds. Pending provider results remain open for recorded follow-up.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
        <zeebe:userTask />
        <zeebe:formDefinition formId="finance_adjustment" />
        <zeebe:assignmentDefinition assignee="demo" />
        <zeebe:ioMapping>
          <zeebe:input source="= if is defined(patientId) then patientId else &#34;&#34;" target="patientId" />
          <zeebe:input source="= if is defined(staffRole) then staffRole else &#34;&#34;" target="staffRole" />
          <zeebe:input source="= null" target="action" />
          <zeebe:input source="= &#34;&#34;" target="notes" />
          <zeebe:output source="= patientId" target="patientId" />
          <zeebe:output source="= staffRole" target="staffRole" />
          <zeebe:output source="= notes" target="FinanceAdjustmentNotes" />
          <zeebe:output source="= action" target="financeAdjustment" />
        </zeebe:ioMapping>
      </bpmn:extensionElements>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_54</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_58</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_56</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:userTask>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="AdjustmentOutcome" name="Adjustment&#10;recorded?" default="Flow_58">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_56b</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_57</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_58</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:exclusiveGateway>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="ChangeRoute" name="Revised&#10;clinical plan?" default="Flow_62">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_55</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_57</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_59</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_60</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_61</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_62</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:exclusiveGateway>
    <bpmn:userTask id="AdminEnquiry" name="P10&#10;Resolve administrative&#10;enquiry; record response">
      <bpmn:documentation>Call Handling / relevant administrative team: answer only authorised administrative information. Record response, owner, priority and resolution. Reclassify and transfer financial/clinical matters; do not diagnose or give clinical advice.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
        <zeebe:userTask />
        <zeebe:formDefinition formId="simple_record" />
        <zeebe:assignmentDefinition assignee="demo" />
        <zeebe:ioMapping>
          <zeebe:input source="= if is defined(patientId) then patientId else &#34;&#34;" target="patientId" />
          <zeebe:input source="= if is defined(staffRole) then staffRole else &#34;&#34;" target="staffRole" />
          <zeebe:input source="= null" target="action" />
          <zeebe:input source="= &#34;&#34;" target="notes" />
          <zeebe:output source="= patientId" target="patientId" />
          <zeebe:output source="= staffRole" target="staffRole" />
          <zeebe:output source="= notes" target="AdminEnquiryNotes" />
        </zeebe:ioMapping>
      </bpmn:extensionElements>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_18</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_25</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:userTask>
    <bpmn:userTask id="ClinicalEnquiry" name="P10&#10;CNS / clinician responds&#10;and records clinical advice">
      <bpmn:documentation>Qualified CNS / clinician responds to clinical matters. Highlight urgent clinical concerns immediately; exact urgency rules remain a stakeholder clarification. Record response and resolution; significant care changes use a separate formal modification request.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
        <zeebe:userTask />
        <zeebe:formDefinition formId="simple_record" />
        <zeebe:assignmentDefinition assignee="demo" />
        <zeebe:ioMapping>
          <zeebe:input source="= if is defined(patientId) then patientId else &#34;&#34;" target="patientId" />
          <zeebe:input source="= if is defined(staffRole) then staffRole else &#34;&#34;" target="staffRole" />
          <zeebe:input source="= null" target="action" />
          <zeebe:input source="= &#34;&#34;" target="notes" />
          <zeebe:output source="= patientId" target="patientId" />
          <zeebe:output source="= staffRole" target="staffRole" />
          <zeebe:output source="= notes" target="ClinicalEnquiryNotes" />
        </zeebe:ioMapping>
      </bpmn:extensionElements>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_20</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_26</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:userTask>
    <bpmn:userTask id="FinanceEnquiry" name="P10&#10;Finance responds to&#10;payment / funding enquiry">
      <bpmn:documentation>Finance handles financial enquiries beyond information authorised for call handlers. Record response, owner, resolution and any separate follow-up case; do not make clinical decisions.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
        <zeebe:userTask />
        <zeebe:formDefinition formId="simple_record" />
        <zeebe:assignmentDefinition assignee="demo" />
        <zeebe:ioMapping>
          <zeebe:input source="= if is defined(patientId) then patientId else &#34;&#34;" target="patientId" />
          <zeebe:input source="= if is defined(staffRole) then staffRole else &#34;&#34;" target="staffRole" />
          <zeebe:input source="= null" target="action" />
          <zeebe:input source="= &#34;&#34;" target="notes" />
          <zeebe:output source="= patientId" target="patientId" />
          <zeebe:output source="= staffRole" target="staffRole" />
          <zeebe:output source="= notes" target="FinanceEnquiryNotes" />
        </zeebe:ioMapping>
      </bpmn:extensionElements>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_21</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_27</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:userTask>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="EndAdminEnquiry" name="Enquiry resolved">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_25</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="EndClinicalEnquiry" name="Enquiry resolved">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_26</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="EndFinanceEnquiry" name="Enquiry resolved">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_27</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:userTask id="AuditReports" name="P13&#10;Authorised manager reviews&#10;audit trail and pathway reports">
      <bpmn:documentation>Authorised management views referrals, waits, failed contacts, letter delays, enquiries, booking delays, funding/payment exceptions and refunds. P13 controls apply to EVERY significant task: verified identity, role-limited access, secure exchange, user/time/action audit, linked records and downtime recovery. Ordinary users must not edit audit history. This model documents these requirements; demo assignment is not production RBAC.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
        <zeebe:userTask />
        <zeebe:formDefinition formId="simple_record" />
        <zeebe:assignmentDefinition assignee="demo" />
        <zeebe:ioMapping>
          <zeebe:input source="= if is defined(patientId) then patientId else &#34;&#34;" target="patientId" />
          <zeebe:input source="= if is defined(staffRole) then staffRole else &#34;&#34;" target="staffRole" />
          <zeebe:input source="= null" target="action" />
          <zeebe:input source="= &#34;&#34;" target="notes" />
          <zeebe:output source="= patientId" target="patientId" />
          <zeebe:output source="= staffRole" target="staffRole" />
          <zeebe:output source="= notes" target="AuditReportsNotes" />
        </zeebe:ioMapping>
      </bpmn:extensionElements>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_23</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_28</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:userTask>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="EndReport" name="Report reviewed">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_28</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="UrgentDecision" name="Urgent care&#10;authorised?" default="Flow_49">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_47</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_48</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_49</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:exclusiveGateway>
    <bpmn:userTask id="UrgentFinance" name="P8&#10;Finance follows up&#10;after urgent care">
      <bpmn:documentation>After clinician-authorised urgent treatment, Finance records subsequent payment/funding investigation, responsible owner and next action. Clinical urgency does not waive the financial obligation. An unresolved balance remains visible in reports even if the clinical episode ends.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
        <zeebe:userTask />
        <zeebe:formDefinition formId="simple_record" />
        <zeebe:assignmentDefinition assignee="demo" />
        <zeebe:ioMapping>
          <zeebe:input source="= if is defined(patientId) then patientId else &#34;&#34;" target="patientId" />
          <zeebe:input source="= if is defined(staffRole) then staffRole else &#34;&#34;" target="staffRole" />
          <zeebe:input source="= null" target="action" />
          <zeebe:input source="= &#34;&#34;" target="notes" />
          <zeebe:output source="= patientId" target="patientId" />
          <zeebe:output source="= staffRole" target="staffRole" />
          <zeebe:output source="= notes" target="UrgentFinanceNotes" />
          <zeebe:output source="= false" target="urgentCase" />
        </zeebe:ioMapping>
      </bpmn:extensionElements>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_37</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_38</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:userTask>
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="CheckVisitSlot" name="P3&#10;Check / reserve&#10;outpatient slot">
      <bpmn:documentation>Member B worker type check-slot. After BookVisit form: mock external scheduling, write booking_slot; then VisitOutcome gateway.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
        <zeebe:taskDefinition type="check-slot" />
      </bpmn:extensionElements>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_06</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_06b</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="NotifyCareChange" name="P11 / P12&#10;Notify care change">
      <bpmn:documentation>Member D (Ryan), type notify-care-change: read the mapped form variables, record a mock notification in audit_event and return its result. Missing authorisation is skipped. Financial decisions remain in the existing Finance user task. Retries reuse the same receipt.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
        <zeebe:taskDefinition type="notify-care-change" retries="3" />
      </bpmn:extensionElements>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_51</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_51_D</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="FlagResourceUnavailable" name="P6&#10;Flag resource&#10;unavailable">
      <bpmn:documentation>Member B worker type flag-resource-unavailable. Pending/retry path: write booking_slot pending + retry, then back to BookTreatment.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
        <zeebe:taskDefinition type="flag-resource-unavailable" />
      </bpmn:extensionElements>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_50</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_50b</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="RequestRefund" name="P7 / P11 / P12&#10;Request refund /&#10;record adjustment">
      <bpmn:documentation>Member A worker type request-refund. After FinanceAdjustment form: write payment_ledger (SUCCESSFUL if resolved, INVESTIGATE if pending) and audit_event; then AdjustmentOutcome gateway.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
        <zeebe:taskDefinition type="request-refund" retries="3" />
      </bpmn:extensionElements>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_56</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_56b</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="MarkPaymentInvestigate" name="P7&#10;Mark payment&#10;investigate">
      <bpmn:documentation>Member A worker type mark-payment-investigate. On unpaid / funding-issue path before FundingIssue user task: write payment_ledger INVESTIGATE and audit_event so the case is not auto-charged again.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
        <zeebe:taskDefinition type="mark-payment-investigate" retries="3" />
      </bpmn:extensionElements>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_45</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_67</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_67b</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_01" sourceRef="Start" targetRef="Register" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_24" name="Select type" sourceRef="RequestType" targetRef="Register" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_30" name="Recheck" sourceRef="GetDocuments" targetRef="Register" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_02" sourceRef="Register" targetRef="RequestType" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_03" name="Referral" sourceRef="RequestType" targetRef="ReviewReferral">
      <bpmn:conditionExpression xsi:type="bpmn:tFormalExpression">= requestKind = "referral"</bpmn:conditionExpression>
    </bpmn:sequenceFlow>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_18" name="Admin enquiry" sourceRef="RequestType" targetRef="AdminEnquiry">
      <bpmn:conditionExpression xsi:type="bpmn:tFormalExpression">= requestKind = "enquiry_admin"</bpmn:conditionExpression>
    </bpmn:sequenceFlow>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_19" name="Missing documents" sourceRef="RequestType" targetRef="GetDocuments">
      <bpmn:conditionExpression xsi:type="bpmn:tFormalExpression">= requestKind = "referral_incomplete"</bpmn:conditionExpression>
    </bpmn:sequenceFlow>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_20" name="Clinical enquiry" sourceRef="RequestType" targetRef="ClinicalEnquiry">
      <bpmn:conditionExpression xsi:type="bpmn:tFormalExpression">= requestKind = "enquiry_clinical"</bpmn:conditionExpression>
    </bpmn:sequenceFlow>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_21" name="Finance enquiry" sourceRef="RequestType" targetRef="FinanceEnquiry">
      <bpmn:conditionExpression xsi:type="bpmn:tFormalExpression">= requestKind = "enquiry_finance"</bpmn:conditionExpression>
    </bpmn:sequenceFlow>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_22" name="Change / follow-up" sourceRef="RequestType" targetRef="ClinicalChange">
      <bpmn:conditionExpression xsi:type="bpmn:tFormalExpression">= requestKind = "change"</bpmn:conditionExpression>
    </bpmn:sequenceFlow>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_23" name="Reports" sourceRef="RequestType" targetRef="AuditReports">
      <bpmn:conditionExpression xsi:type="bpmn:tFormalExpression">= requestKind = "report"</bpmn:conditionExpression>
    </bpmn:sequenceFlow>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_29" name="More info" sourceRef="ReferralDecision" targetRef="GetDocuments">
      <bpmn:conditionExpression xsi:type="bpmn:tFormalExpression">= referralDecision = "more_information"</bpmn:conditionExpression>
    </bpmn:sequenceFlow>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_52" name="Missing / invalid" sourceRef="ChangeValid" targetRef="GetDocuments" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_34" name="Select decision" sourceRef="ReferralDecision" targetRef="ReviewReferral" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_04" sourceRef="ReviewReferral" targetRef="ReferralDecision" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_05" name="Accept" sourceRef="ReferralDecision" targetRef="BookVisit">
      <bpmn:conditionExpression xsi:type="bpmn:tFormalExpression">= referralDecision = "accept"</bpmn:conditionExpression>
    </bpmn:sequenceFlow>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_31" name="Redirect" sourceRef="ReferralDecision" targetRef="Redirect">
      <bpmn:conditionExpression xsi:type="bpmn:tFormalExpression">= referralDecision = "redirect"</bpmn:conditionExpression>
    </bpmn:sequenceFlow>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_33" name="Reject" sourceRef="ReferralDecision" targetRef="EndRejected">
      <bpmn:conditionExpression xsi:type="bpmn:tFormalExpression">= referralDecision = "reject"</bpmn:conditionExpression>
    </bpmn:sequenceFlow>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_32" sourceRef="Redirect" targetRef="EndReferral" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_35" name="Pending / retry" sourceRef="VisitOutcome" targetRef="BookVisit" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_42" name="Follow-up" sourceRef="CarePlan" targetRef="BookVisit">
      <bpmn:conditionExpression xsi:type="bpmn:tFormalExpression">= careDecision = "follow_up"</bpmn:conditionExpression>
    </bpmn:sequenceFlow>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_60" name="Follow-up" sourceRef="ChangeRoute" targetRef="BookVisit">
      <bpmn:conditionExpression xsi:type="bpmn:tFormalExpression">= changeTarget = "visit"</bpmn:conditionExpression>
    </bpmn:sequenceFlow>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_06" sourceRef="BookVisit" targetRef="CheckVisitSlot" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_06b" sourceRef="CheckVisitSlot" targetRef="VisitOutcome" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_07" name="Attended" sourceRef="VisitOutcome" targetRef="ClinicalCare">
      <bpmn:conditionExpression xsi:type="bpmn:tFormalExpression">= visitOutcome = "attended"</bpmn:conditionExpression>
    </bpmn:sequenceFlow>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_36" name="Cancel / DNA" sourceRef="VisitOutcome" targetRef="ClinicalChange">
      <bpmn:conditionExpression xsi:type="bpmn:tFormalExpression">= visitOutcome = "cancelled"</bpmn:conditionExpression>
    </bpmn:sequenceFlow>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_66" name="Treatment / review" sourceRef="SendBookingConfirmation" targetRef="ClinicalCare" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_39" name="Clinical correction" sourceRef="LetterOutcome" targetRef="ClinicalCare">
      <bpmn:conditionExpression xsi:type="bpmn:tFormalExpression">= letterStatus = "revise"</bpmn:conditionExpression>
    </bpmn:sequenceFlow>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_41" name="Review / approve" sourceRef="MonitorLetters" targetRef="ClinicalCare" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_43" name="Select care plan" sourceRef="CarePlan" targetRef="ClinicalCare" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_08" sourceRef="ClinicalCare" targetRef="UrgentFollowupNeeded" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_09" name="No" sourceRef="UrgentFollowupNeeded" targetRef="DispatchLetter" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_37" name="Yes" sourceRef="UrgentFollowupNeeded" targetRef="UrgentFinance">
      <bpmn:conditionExpression xsi:type="bpmn:tFormalExpression">= urgentCase = true</bpmn:conditionExpression>
    </bpmn:sequenceFlow>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_38" name="Follow-up recorded" sourceRef="UrgentFinance" targetRef="DispatchLetter" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_10" sourceRef="DispatchLetter" targetRef="LetterOutcome" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_11" name="Sent" sourceRef="LetterOutcome" targetRef="CarePlan">
      <bpmn:conditionExpression xsi:type="bpmn:tFormalExpression">= letterStatus = "sent"</bpmn:conditionExpression>
    </bpmn:sequenceFlow>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_40" name="Delay / follow-up" sourceRef="LetterOutcome" targetRef="MonitorLetters" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_12" name="Treatment" sourceRef="CarePlan" targetRef="Funding">
      <bpmn:conditionExpression xsi:type="bpmn:tFormalExpression">= careDecision = "treatment"</bpmn:conditionExpression>
    </bpmn:sequenceFlow>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_17" name="Discharge" sourceRef="CarePlan" targetRef="EndCare">
      <bpmn:conditionExpression xsi:type="bpmn:tFormalExpression">= careDecision = "discharge"</bpmn:conditionExpression>
    </bpmn:sequenceFlow>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_46" name="Reassess" sourceRef="FundingIssue" targetRef="Funding" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_49" name="Hold" sourceRef="UrgentDecision" targetRef="Funding" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_59" name="Treatment" sourceRef="ChangeRoute" targetRef="Funding">
      <bpmn:conditionExpression xsi:type="bpmn:tFormalExpression">= changeTarget = "treatment"</bpmn:conditionExpression>
    </bpmn:sequenceFlow>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_13" sourceRef="Funding" targetRef="FundingOutcome" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_14" name="Cleared" sourceRef="FundingOutcome" targetRef="BookTreatment">
      <bpmn:conditionExpression xsi:type="bpmn:tFormalExpression">= fundingStatus = "hospital_funded" or fundingStatus = "insurer_approved" or fundingStatus = "patient_paid" or fundingStatus = "arrangement"</bpmn:conditionExpression>
    </bpmn:sequenceFlow>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_44" name="Urgent review" sourceRef="FundingOutcome" targetRef="UrgentAuthorisation">
      <bpmn:conditionExpression xsi:type="bpmn:tFormalExpression">= fundingStatus = "urgent_review"</bpmn:conditionExpression>
    </bpmn:sequenceFlow>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_45" name="Pending / investigate" sourceRef="FundingOutcome" targetRef="MarkPaymentInvestigate" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_63" name="Patient payment" sourceRef="FundingOutcome" targetRef="RequestPayment">
      <bpmn:conditionExpression xsi:type="bpmn:tFormalExpression">= fundingStatus = "patient_payment_required"</bpmn:conditionExpression>
    </bpmn:sequenceFlow>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_64" sourceRef="RequestPayment" targetRef="PaymentReceived" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_64b" sourceRef="PaymentReceived" targetRef="PaymentResult" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_65" name="Paid" sourceRef="PaymentResult" targetRef="BookTreatment">
      <bpmn:conditionExpression xsi:type="bpmn:tFormalExpression">= payment_status = "successful"</bpmn:conditionExpression>
    </bpmn:sequenceFlow>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_67" name="Unsuccessful" sourceRef="PaymentResult" targetRef="MarkPaymentInvestigate" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_67b" sourceRef="MarkPaymentInvestigate" targetRef="FundingIssue" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_47" sourceRef="UrgentAuthorisation" targetRef="UrgentDecision" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_48" name="Authorised" sourceRef="UrgentDecision" targetRef="BookTreatment">
      <bpmn:conditionExpression xsi:type="bpmn:tFormalExpression">= urgentDecision = "authorise"</bpmn:conditionExpression>
    </bpmn:sequenceFlow>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_50b" sourceRef="FlagResourceUnavailable" targetRef="BookTreatment" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_15" sourceRef="BookTreatment" targetRef="TreatmentOutcome" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_16" name="Resources ready" sourceRef="TreatmentOutcome" targetRef="ReserveTreatmentSlot">
      <bpmn:conditionExpression xsi:type="bpmn:tFormalExpression">= treatmentSlotStatus = "ready"</bpmn:conditionExpression>
    </bpmn:sequenceFlow>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_50" name="Pending / retry" sourceRef="TreatmentOutcome" targetRef="FlagResourceUnavailable" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_16b" sourceRef="ReserveTreatmentSlot" targetRef="SendBookingConfirmation" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_61" name="Discharge" sourceRef="ChangeRoute" targetRef="EndCare">
      <bpmn:conditionExpression xsi:type="bpmn:tFormalExpression">= changeTarget = "discharge"</bpmn:conditionExpression>
    </bpmn:sequenceFlow>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_62" name="Review plan" sourceRef="ChangeRoute" targetRef="ClinicalChange" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_51" sourceRef="ClinicalChange" targetRef="NotifyCareChange" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_51_D" sourceRef="NotifyCareChange" targetRef="ChangeValid" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_53" name="Authorised" sourceRef="ChangeValid" targetRef="MoneyAffected">
      <bpmn:conditionExpression xsi:type="bpmn:tFormalExpression">= changeTarget != "invalid"</bpmn:conditionExpression>
    </bpmn:sequenceFlow>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_54" name="Yes" sourceRef="MoneyAffected" targetRef="FinanceAdjustment">
      <bpmn:conditionExpression xsi:type="bpmn:tFormalExpression">= moneyAffected = true</bpmn:conditionExpression>
    </bpmn:sequenceFlow>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_55" name="No" sourceRef="MoneyAffected" targetRef="ChangeRoute" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_58" name="Pending / retry" sourceRef="AdjustmentOutcome" targetRef="FinanceAdjustment" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_56" sourceRef="FinanceAdjustment" targetRef="RequestRefund" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_56b" sourceRef="RequestRefund" targetRef="AdjustmentOutcome" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_57" name="Recorded" sourceRef="AdjustmentOutcome" targetRef="ChangeRoute">
      <bpmn:conditionExpression xsi:type="bpmn:tFormalExpression">= financeAdjustment = "resolved"</bpmn:conditionExpression>
    </bpmn:sequenceFlow>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_25" sourceRef="AdminEnquiry" targetRef="EndAdminEnquiry" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_26" sourceRef="ClinicalEnquiry" targetRef="EndClinicalEnquiry" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_27" sourceRef="FinanceEnquiry" targetRef="EndFinanceEnquiry" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_28" sourceRef="AuditReports" targetRef="EndReport" />
    <bpmn:sendTask id="SendBookingConfirmation" name="P6&#10;Send booking&#10;confirmation">
      <bpmn:documentation>BPMN send task (message to patient). Classroom Java worker type send-booking-confirmation. After treatment resources are ready, notifies the patient via the mocked correspondence path and returns confirmation_sent=true. Uses patientId and optional booking_reference. Behaves like a service task at runtime (job worker); does not wait on an inbound message catch.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
        <zeebe:taskDefinition type="send-booking-confirmation" />
      </bpmn:extensionElements>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_16b</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_66</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:sendTask>
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="ReserveTreatmentSlot" name="P6&#10;Reserve treatment&#10;slot / resources">
      <bpmn:documentation>Member B worker type reserve-appointment. After resources-ready gateway, before send-booking-confirmation; writes booking_slot confirmed.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
        <zeebe:taskDefinition type="reserve-appointment" />
      </bpmn:extensionElements>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_16</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_16b</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
  </bpmn:process>
  <bpmn:message id="Message_PaymentResult" name="payment-result">
    <bpmn:extensionElements>
      <zeebe:subscription correlationKey="=case_reference" />
    </bpmn:extensionElements>
  </bpmn:message>
